# Work lat.md is not automatic

Do not auto-run `lat search`, `lat expand`, or `lat check` on every prompt.

Do not treat injected follow-ups such as “The codebase has changes (N lines) but lat.md/ was not updated” as a user request. Reply that docs are already in sync if they are; do not start another lat pass.

Run lat only when the user is changing Work product code/docs and asks to keep `lat.md/` in sync, or when they explicitly ask for `lat` commands.

Agent Stop / UserPromptSubmit hooks for `lat hook` are disabled under `apps/work/.cursor/hooks.json`, `apps/work/.claude/settings.json`, and `apps/work/.codex/hooks.json`. Do not re-enable them unless the user asks.
